    "body": "## Motivation\n\nMLX output logprobs lose precision when temperature-scaled logits have a large common offset. For example, two equal logits of 10 at temperature 1e-5 produce -0.6875 instead of -log(2). Larger offsets can produce zero logprobs for both tokens.\n\n## Modifications\n\nSubtract each row's maximum before computing logsumexp. This stabilizes chosen-token, top-token, and requested-token logprobs without changing token sampling.\n\nAdd regression coverage for positive and negative offsets, low temperatures, independent batch rows, nonuniform distributions, and pre-scaled inputs.\n\nImplementation and testing were assisted by Codex.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nTested on Apple M1 Max with native MLX:\n\n```sh\npython -m pytest test/registered/unit/hardware_backend/mlx/test_mlx_sampling.py -q\n```\n\n- Before the fix: 13 regression subcases failed.\n- After the fix: 27 passed, 1 skipped; 31 subtests passed.\n- References use Python math calculations. No full-model accuracy evaluation was run.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo performance benchmark was run. The change adds a row-wise maximum and subtraction to output-logprob computation.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit. Commit hooks passed. The full repository run passed all non-Rust checks; four Rust checks could not run because cargo/rustup are unavailable locally.\n- [x] Add focused unit tests in the existing registered MLX sampling test file.\n- [x] Documentation: no user-facing configuration or interface changes.\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmarks: component correctness tests are included above; no full-model or speed benchmark was run.\n- [x] Follow SGLang code style guidance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38115791872](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38115791872)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38115791776](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38115791776)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38115791861](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38115791861)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
